  "zm_subcloud_tendency": {
   "description": "Subcloud tendency of q1q2_pjr, -F[k]/dsubcld with F = zm_flux the layer-centered plume flux (zm_convr.F90:2612-2619, 2677-2684): the negative of the plume flux at level k divided by the subcloud layer thickness dsubcld, gathered at index maxg by the tendency masks; also the subcloud launch-level change dtbdt/dqbdt of the closure (F90:2469-2471) with the roles of xhat and xu/xd swapped (shat - su = -(su - shat)). Applied once for moisture (sub_dqdt, xu = qu, xd = qd, xhat = qhat) and once for dry static energy (sub_dsdt, xu = su, xd = sd, xhat = shat).",
   "params": [
    "mu",
    "xu",
